---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Ootdbuy Shipping Guide | Ootdbuy Findsheet">
  <section class="wrap tool-page">
    <p class="eyebrow"><a href="/guides/">Buying guide</a> / Shipping</p>
    <h1>Ootdbuy shipping guide</h1>
    <p class="intro">Compare current quotes for your destination after you know the packed size and weight of your parcel.</p>
    <div class="guide-list">
      <article><h2>Separate item cost and freight</h2><p>Use the seller price for the item itself. For the parcel total, check local delivery, international freight and any extra services itemized by Ootdbuy.</p></article>
      <article><h2>Compare the lines available to you</h2><p>Use Ootdbuy’s calculator from its homepage. Check the packed dimensions as well as the weight, since a bulky parcel may be billed by volume.</p></article>
      <article><h2>Confirm the final quote</h2><p>Check the quote shown on Ootdbuy for your warehouse parcel, including the selected destination, packaging and carrier restrictions.</p></article>
    </div>
    <div class="button-row"><a class="button primary" href="https://ootdbuy.com/">Open Ootdbuy</a><a class="button outline" href="https://ootdbuy.com/notice/details?id=1740661564720123906">Official delivery charges</a></div>
  </section>
</Layout>
